  "description": "Update you may have missed...",
  "body_html": "<p>This week was similar to last…down, down, up, up, up. Small red candles breaking spirits early on, only to close higher 2 days later. We did nothing from February 12th on, protecting capital and noted the stock market had returned to bullish trajectory April 8th. Started buying again April 14th, in which those positions are up. So I will say it one last time, as I have the last few months: <strong>there is no reason to be a bear! </strong>I love making a good bearish forecast, but these are not the conditions for it. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png\" width=\"1385\" height=\"813\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:813,&quot;width&quot;:1385,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:135535,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/196146352?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ro1g!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff69e01a4-a650-4e45-aea1-61c655e2d6da_1385x813.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Market is, oddly, still shaking people out. But trend has been UP. Ignore the headlines!</figcaption></figure></div><p>Going forward, the <strong>key aspect I am looking for is the “pop” in price action</strong>. A sector or a handful of names to break out of their consolidations to confirm bullish momentum. I am optimistic, because there are <strong>so many</strong> great chart structures, with Volatility Contraction Patterns on them (one of the key variables why I never switched to a bear). If there were only a few VCP’s out there, I would be less optimistic, but we are seeing a plethora of VCP’s…all those stocks can’t be lying about the future. </p><h4>When we get those “pops”… expect far more aggressive maneuvering (buying) from me. We have just been easing into positions. But when the trend is working, we double, triple and quadruple down.</h4><p>If you missed any of these posts this week, they are linked below for your convenience:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-positions-update?r=4z8lgl\">My Positions Update</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-everything-update?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Everything Update</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-252063603?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">How I Find Great Trades With Pizza</a> - Its a little ridiculous, but it works</p></li></ul><p>The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> also broke another high, and is currently leading the S&amp;P 500 by about 7%. Sometimes I get asked: “Is it too late to buy into these?” - NO. I built the StockTok ETF with 3 primary goals:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Beat the S&amp;P 500 </strong>(its doing that)</p></li><li><p>Though I don’t give price targets, <strong>the goal is for 30% - 50%</strong> gains for the year. Somewhere in that range (guesstimate). Of course I cannot guarantee anything, a black swan event can change everything…<em><strong>but ~10% gain means I am only 1/5th of the way to my mental goal, meaning I expect more “runway”.</strong></em></p></li><li><p><strong>Hands off, relaxed investing</strong>. With the tumultuous news, the volatility is crushing spirits and portfolios. Will it be the biggest winner of 2026? Unlikely…but I am confident it will perform well, while we have our feet propped up. </p></li></ol><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2tAq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F78fddae2-d2ac-4dd5-b987-a68211560c70_868x826.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2tAq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F78fddae2-d2ac-4dd5-b987-a68211560c70_868x826.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2tAq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F78fddae2-d2ac-4dd5-b987-a68211560c70_868x826.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2tAq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F78fddae2-d2ac-4dd5-b987-a68211560c70_868x826.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2tAq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F78fddae2-d2ac-4dd5-b987-a68211560c70_868x826.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2tAq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F78fddae2-d2ac-4dd5-b987-a68211560c70_868x826.png\" width=\"868\" height=\"826\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/78fddae2-d2ac-4dd5-b987-a68211560c70_868x826.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:826,&quot;width&quot;:868,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&q